  "notes": "B.S. Biology, Department of Biology. SEMESTER SYSTEM — all credits are semester hours. Built from the official MSU Denver Requirements for B.S. in Biology (2024-2025 or future catalogs; http://msudenver.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/BIO-BS-2024-25-FINAL.pdf). Major: 47cr BIO (at least 46 required; 36cr upper-division, at least 27 required) including BIO 1080/1090, 1081/1091, 2400 General Microbiology, 3520 General Ecology, 3600 General Genetics, 3050 Cell Biology, 3350 Immunology, 3340 Endocrinology, 4300 Neurobiology, 4230 Issues in Conservation Biology (Senior Experience), 4850 Evolution, 4510 Microbial Ecology, 3000 Advances in Biology, 3020 Lab Techniques. Required non-BIO: CHE 1800/1801, CHE 1810/1811, MTH 1110, MTH 1210. Non-Biology Science Electives 10cr (at least 9 required, 6cr upper-division): CHE 3100, CHE 3110, MTH 1410. Biology/Chemistry/Math fulfill Natural & Physical Sciences and Quantitative Literacy General Studies. 42cr upper-division total (at least 39 required). C or better required in BIO courses. 120 semester credits total.",
